  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blended Finance for Energy Transition (BFET)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalyse mobilisation of up to USD 1bn from private investors by leveraging up to USD 50 (USD 14.7m from Denmark) of catalytic donor capital provided as part of the Blended Finance for Energy Transition (BFET). The capital will work to reduce GHG emissions in high-emitting middle income countries with at least 51% focus on the JETP relevant countries India, Indonesia, Vietnam and South Africa. The mobilised investments will create quality jobs directly in the energy sector and indirectly from increased growth.</narrative>
  </description>
